      "note": "**Hurt** is irregular: the past tense and past participle are both **hurt**."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "I fell and I hurt.",
      "correct": "I fell and hurt myself.",
      "note": "When you cause pain to your own body, **hurt** needs an object: **hurt myself**, **hurt my arm**, or use **get hurt**."
    }
